(6218918, 919063, 83313, '<td valign="top">Comes off quite flat to me, but I think this has some good potential with some adjustments. I did a screen grab and popped this into PSP to see. A quick adjustment of levels (there is a big flat spot on the high end of the histogram), some saturation and a touch of clarify brought out some nice detail and pop.</td>', 'Comes off quite flat to me, but I think this has some good potential with some adjustments. I did a screen grab and popped this into PSP to see. A quick adjustment of levels (there is a big flat spot on the high end of the histogram), some saturation and a touch of clarify brought out some nice detail and pop.', '2010-11-10 13:29:37.000000', NULL, 1),
