(6219092, 918952, 103142, '<td valign="top">I love the window and the sunset. I like the shadow and the triangle, but I''m not sure I like them together. My eye keeps hopping back and forth, and they just don''t seem to go together. Leaves a little uncomfortable. If it was just the window -- 8. If it were just the triangle and shadow -- 8. Together I think they''re a 7 (which is still higher than most of the scores I''m giving in the challenge. :)</td>', 'I love the window and the sunset. I like the shadow and the triangle, but I''m not sure I like them together. My eye keeps hopping back and forth, and they just don''t seem to go together. Leaves a little uncomfortable. If it was just the window -- 8. If it were just the triangle and shadow -- 8. Together I think they''re a 7 (which is still higher than most of the scores I''m giving in the challenge. :)', '2010-11-10 16:02:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6219120, 918999, 112828, '<td valign="top">Man, what a ton of work, and yet you''ve left the napkin askew... damn.<br/> <br/>So nearly perfect but that small detail immediately catches my eye.</td>', 'Man, what a ton of work, and yet you''ve left the napkin askew... damn. So nearly perfect but that small detail immediately catches my eye.', '2010-11-10 16:21:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6219123, 918125, 112828, '<td valign="top">=\  The image is unfortunately rotated just a bit CCW, in some cases I would assume it was intentional, but with eyecandy like this, it either needs to be substantially rotated, or absolutely straight..  This is neither, but it is quite pretty none-the-less....</td>', '=\  The image is unfortunately rotated just a bit CCW, in some cases I would assume it was intentional, but with eyecandy like this, it either needs to be substantially rotated, or absolutely straight..  This is neither, but it is quite pretty none-the-less....', '2010-11-10 16:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
