(6219130, 919182, 112828, '<td valign="top">This is the most interesting spiral staircase entry..  I think the people add to the interest, and I particularly like the processing.</td>', 'This is the most interesting spiral staircase entry..  I think the people add to the interest, and I particularly like the processing.', '2010-11-10 16:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6219132, 919187, 112828, '<td valign="top">What''s that in the sky? It''s a bird, no it''s a plane, no-- It really is a bird! :)<br/> <br/>Excellent textures, and quite a wonderful landscape, but I''m not sure if this really works for "shapes"..   I''m not going to vote on it, so don''t worry, I''m not going to hurt your score..<br/> <br/>I also dislike the footprint, but other than that I think this is a wonderful image, really very nice to examine.</td>', 'What''s that in the sky? It''s a bird, no it''s a plane, no-- It really is a bird! :) Excellent textures, and quite a wonderful landscape, but I''m not sure if this really works for "shapes"..   I''m not going to vote on it, so don''t worry, I''m not going to hurt your score.. I also dislike the footprint, but other than that I think this is a wonderful image, really very nice to examine.', '2010-11-10 16:29:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6219137, 918897, 112828, '<td valign="top">Oh dear... I don''t think this is going to do very well..<br/> <br/>The image is noisy, heavily cropped, and needs a CCW rotation.<br/> <br/>Beyond that the subject is going to be seen as mundane.  For better, or for worse DPC loves eyecandy, flash and glitz, and hates off-center, poorly rotated, noisy stuff...   <br/> <br/>Good try, but this is going to get punished..  A rotation and heavy dose of Topaz De-Noise, along with a centered crop would have gone a long, long, long way for the score of this image.</td>', 'Oh dear... I don''t think this is going to do very well.. The image is noisy, heavily cropped, and needs a CCW rotation. Beyond that the subject is going to be seen as mundane.  For better, or for worse DPC loves eyecandy, flash and glitz, and hates off-center, poorly rotated, noisy stuff...    Good try, but this is going to get punished..  A rotation and heavy dose of Topaz De-Noise, along with a centered crop would have gone a long, long, long way for the score of this image.', '2010-11-10 16:33:40.000000', NULL, 1),
