(6221143, 918952, 108069, '<td valign="top">What in the... I''m mesmerized by this thing. And the shadow. How in the...<br/> <br/>Nice composition, interesting shot. And finally a shape. Nice work.</td>', 'What in the... I''m mesmerized by this thing. And the shadow. How in the... Nice composition, interesting shot. And finally a shape. Nice work.', '2010-11-12 19:32:28.000000', NULL, 1),
