(6221903, 918951, 76335, '<td valign="top">Old gas tanks -- the newest DPC cliche? As these things go, this is rather nice, and I like the way its set against the clapboard and window frame. The competing reds provide good counterpoint.</td>', 'Old gas tanks -- the newest DPC cliche? As these things go, this is rather nice, and I like the way its set against the clapboard and window frame. The competing reds provide good counterpoint.', '2010-11-14 00:06:06.000000', NULL, 1),
