(6222043, 918869, 76335, '<td valign="top">Great composition. I might have white balanced against a cloud -- or done this in black and white. Still very cool.</td>', 'Great composition. I might have white balanced against a cloud -- or done this in black and white. Still very cool.', '2010-11-14 10:40:27.000000', NULL, 1),
