(6222077, 918202, 76335, '<td valign="top">Pentalicious!</td>', 'Pentalicious!', '2010-11-14 11:52:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6222078, 919143, 76335, '<td valign="top">This is interesting. The technical flaws are many, but my suspicion is that you weren''t out to make a technically perfect photo. The flat lighting and motion blur make this very unique. I like it for what it isn''t.</td>', 'This is interesting. The technical flaws are many, but my suspicion is that you weren''t out to make a technically perfect photo. The flat lighting and motion blur make this very unique. I like it for what it isn''t.', '2010-11-14 11:54:04.000000', NULL, 1),
