(6222266, 919084, 114225, '<td valign="top">Wonderful idea for this challenge. Very good balance to this photo, and the B&amp;W conversion is a good choice.</td>', 'Wonderful idea for this challenge. Very good balance to this photo, and the B&W conversion is a good choice.', '2010-11-14 16:07:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6222267, 919186, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice idea for the challenge. I feel this photo is just a bit flat. Seems like a bit of added contrast could have helped it out.</td>', 'Nice idea for the challenge. I feel this photo is just a bit flat. Seems like a bit of added contrast could have helped it out.', '2010-11-14 16:08:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6222272, 919063, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like your thought behind this photo. The filled frame is good. HOwever, the photo itself just doesn''t have much pop. Here are some suggestions I have:<br/>* It looks like you used on camera flash, which is causing some very harsh shadows. With a still subject like this, I would haver rather seen a tripod and long shutter used.<br/>* The contrast and saturation both seem a bit low. Try increasing them slightly.</td>', 'I like your thought behind this photo. The filled frame is good. HOwever, the photo itself just doesn''t have much pop. Here are some suggestions I have:* It looks like you used on camera flash, which is causing some very harsh shadows. With a still subject like this, I would haver rather seen a tripod and long shutter used.* The contrast and saturation both seem a bit low. Try increasing them slightly.', '2010-11-14 16:16:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6222273, 918710, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very nice symetry to this photo, and nice greyscale as well.</td>', 'Very nice symetry to this photo, and nice greyscale as well.', '2010-11-14 16:17:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6222275, 919078, 114225, '<td valign="top">I guess I''m failing to see how the shape of this subject is the key feature to this particular photo. Also, it''s a bit too dark for my tastes (no pun intended).</td>', 'I guess I''m failing to see how the shape of this subject is the key feature to this particular photo. Also, it''s a bit too dark for my tastes (no pun intended).', '2010-11-14 16:19:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6222277, 918867, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice idea here, especially with the background. I do with the in focus lego was more detailed, as I would expect to easily read the worlds on the knobs.</td>', 'Nice idea here, especially with the background. I do with the in focus lego was more detailed, as I would expect to easily read the worlds on the knobs.', '2010-11-14 16:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6222280, 919158, 114225, '<td valign="top">I really enjoy the the colors, shadows, and angles of this entry.</td>', 'I really enjoy the the colors, shadows, and angles of this entry.', '2010-11-14 16:23:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6222281, 918999, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice geometry and balance to this photo.</td>', 'Nice geometry and balance to this photo.', '2010-11-14 16:24:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6222349, 918031, 117534, '<td valign="top">OOOOO I love this! the dreamy effect and the shape and your use of color (or er non-color) VERY VERY NICE!!</td>', 'OOOOO I love this! the dreamy effect and the shape and your use of color (or er non-color) VERY VERY NICE!!', '2010-11-14 18:06:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6222357, 918869, 117534, '<td valign="top">Very unique! ++ for your idea!</td>', 'Very unique! ++ for your idea!', '2010-11-14 18:09:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6222373, 919054, 121159, '<td valign="top">4.5</td>', '4.5', '2010-11-14 18:13:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6222375, 918952, 117534, '<td valign="top">The only thing to me that keeps this from a Perfect 10 is the window at the right.. Just my humble opinion .. 9</td>', 'The only thing to me that keeps this from a Perfect 10 is the window at the right.. Just my humble opinion .. 9', '2010-11-14 18:15:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6222379, 919180, 117534, '<td valign="top">really meets challange and has an outstanding art effect... I normally don''t really feel WOW over shape pictures, but this one WOW and the colors get a second WOW</td>', 'really meets challange and has an outstanding art effect... I normally don''t really feel WOW over shape pictures, but this one WOW and the colors get a second WOW', '2010-11-14 18:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6222380, 919084, 117534, '<td valign="top">You made me laugh!! Unique and a great photo as well!! 9</td>', 'You made me laugh!! Unique and a great photo as well!! 9', '2010-11-14 18:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6222381, 918442, 117534, '<td valign="top">ah ha I have one of these... very good job of makeing it a very intrestring shape!!</td>', 'ah ha I have one of these... very good job of makeing it a very intrestring shape!!', '2010-11-14 18:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6222383, 918125, 117534, '<td valign="top">simple and very nice!</td>', 'simple and very nice!', '2010-11-14 18:23:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6222385, 918499, 117534, '<td valign="top">even though I have crawley''s down my back... this is one awesome shot and you made it meet the challenge perfect! First Rate!!!! 9</td>', 'even though I have crawley''s down my back... this is one awesome shot and you made it meet the challenge perfect! First Rate!!!! 9', '2010-11-14 18:24:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6222389, 918358, 117534, '<td valign="top">Simple, crisp, clean and lots of eye candy! Very nice!!</td>', 'Simple, crisp, clean and lots of eye candy! Very nice!!', '2010-11-14 18:26:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6222510, 919182, 37252, '<td valign="top">I love shots like this. I wish I knew of a staircase like this near me. You executed this very well. Love the color tones.</td>', 'I love shots like this. I wish I knew of a staircase like this near me. You executed this very well. Love the color tones.', '2010-11-14 20:42:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6222514, 919158, 37252, '<td valign="top">aarrgghh the little green cube in the middle at the bottom is at the wrong angle! It should match all the other little boxes, no?  I so wish there was a way for me to reach into this photo and correct it. I can''t look any more -- it''s driving me crazy!!!! <br/> <br/> <br/>oh crap, I can''t stop looking, and wanting to fix it. I''m never gonna get to sleep now!</td>', 'aarrgghh the little green cube in the middle at the bottom is at the wrong angle! It should match all the other little boxes, no?  I so wish there was a way for me to reach into this photo and correct it. I can''t look any more -- it''s driving me crazy!!!!   oh crap, I can''t stop looking, and wanting to fix it. I''m never gonna get to sleep now!', '2010-11-14 20:47:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6222561, 918031, 91783, '<td valign="top">i like the whole idea behind this shot. i don''t know if it fits this challenge the best, but i like it. i think it would be better if it was over all brighter. i guess higher contrast...   good luck! :)</td>', 'i like the whole idea behind this shot. i don''t know if it fits this challenge the best, but i like it. i think it would be better if it was over all brighter. i guess higher contrast...   good luck! :)', '2010-11-14 21:41:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6222645, 919099, 30364, '<td valign="top">Yes I suppose it is (a <i>barra inversa</i>).  Whatever it is, it''s an interesting image with some very absorbing details of both colour &amp; texture. I''m enjoying playing with the idea that it is a picture of something very small, or of something very big.  I don''t care which is true; I like it either way.  So both is true.  Thank you.</td>', 'Yes I suppose it is (a barra inversa).  Whatever it is, it''s an interesting image with some very absorbing details of both colour & texture. I''m enjoying playing with the idea that it is a picture of something very small, or of something very big.  I don''t care which is true; I like it either way.  So both is true.  Thank you.', '2010-11-14 23:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6222648, 918997, 30364, '<td valign="top">Just enough nothing to be something, and vice-versa.  I enjoyed the little excursion it took me on, as a relief from the many tedious literalist images that will no doubt finish much higher in the challenge results.  Thank you.</td>', 'Just enough nothing to be something, and vice-versa.  I enjoyed the little excursion it took me on, as a relief from the many tedious literalist images that will no doubt finish much higher in the challenge results.  Thank you.', '2010-11-14 23:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6222651, 918088, 30364, '<td valign="top">I like the uncertain orientation, and I admire the perfect exposure.  I will forgive you for the blatant lack of grain, noise, blur or any other ''flaws''.  Just this once.  Thank you.</td>', 'I like the uncertain orientation, and I admire the perfect exposure.  I will forgive you for the blatant lack of grain, noise, blur or any other ''flaws''.  Just this once.  Thank you.', '2010-11-14 23:59:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6222656, 919115, 30364, '<td valign="top">Plenty to enjoy here.  Anthropomorphic shape looks like it''s moonwalking out of a follow spot.  Top three pick for me.  Thank you.</td>', 'Plenty to enjoy here.  Anthropomorphic shape looks like it''s moonwalking out of a follow spot.  Top three pick for me.  Thank you.', '2010-11-15 00:01:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6222676, 919139, 30364, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully ambivalent, contrarian photograph.  A low fidelity photograph with a high fidelity resonance.  If only more people appreciated how that contradiction works!  <br/> <br/>My top pick in this challenge (10).  Thank you.</td>', 'Wonderfully ambivalent, contrarian photograph.  A low fidelity photograph with a high fidelity resonance.  If only more people appreciated how that contradiction works!   My top pick in this challenge (10).  Thank you.', '2010-11-15 00:11:29.000000', NULL, 1);
