(6223073, 919078, 33736, '<td valign="top">Yes, the cup lip is round, and the splashes are shapes (pretty ones at that!)  But, it''s almost as though the picture is so good as a whole that the idea of "shape" just doesn''t stand out for me.</td>', 'Yes, the cup lip is round, and the splashes are shapes (pretty ones at that!)  But, it''s almost as though the picture is so good as a whole that the idea of "shape" just doesn''t stand out for me.', '2010-11-15 04:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
