(6223085, 918387, 33736, '<td valign="top">The cylinders are not the main focal point of the image, so I don''t believe it says, "Shape" as much as it does people or scene or something else.</td>', 'The cylinders are not the main focal point of the image, so I don''t believe it says, "Shape" as much as it does people or scene or something else.', '2010-11-15 04:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
