(6224767, 919184, 91342, '<td valign="top">Very nice image; I just tend to think more of this is a human than of a shape(s).</td>', 'Very nice image; I just tend to think more of this is a human than of a shape(s).', '2010-11-16 18:55:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6224773, 918505, 91342, '<td valign="top">Love the title.</td>', 'Love the title.', '2010-11-16 18:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6224789, 919182, 59796, '<td valign="top">The spiral just draws you in. And all the folks on it just add to the charm. Great conversion to sepia as well - I would''ve been disappointed if it were in color and the banisters were glittering gold or something :) A ribbon winner in my book. <br/>My only nit is that the center of the spiral is the center of the picture as well.</td>', 'The spiral just draws you in. And all the folks on it just add to the charm. Great conversion to sepia as well - I would''ve been disappointed if it were in color and the banisters were glittering gold or something :) A ribbon winner in my book. My only nit is that the center of the spiral is the center of the picture as well.', '2010-11-16 19:05:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6224796, 918271, 59796, '<td valign="top">Simple and effective. Nothing to distract from the interesting spiral of an everyday object. Well done - a ribbon winner in my book.</td>', 'Simple and effective. Nothing to distract from the interesting spiral of an everyday object. Well done - a ribbon winner in my book.', '2010-11-16 19:10:31.000000', NULL, 1),
