(6225839, 919182, 112972, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Tonberry:</b></div><hr/><i> Wow. This is really an incredible shot... Is there any chance you have prints available? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks Tonberry!  All my prints are sold on my personal website.  There is a link for it on my profile page.  I will add this one in the next few days.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-11-17 12:02:52.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by Tonberry: Wow. This is really an incredible shot... Is there any chance you have prints available?   Thanks Tonberry!  All my prints are sold on my personal website.  There is a link for it on my profile page.  I will add this one in the next few days.', '2010-11-17 12:01:52.000000', '2010-11-17 12:02:52.000000', 0),
