(6226001, 918088, 54645, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by ubique:</b></div><hr/><i> I like the uncertain orientation, and I admire the perfect exposure.  I will forgive you for the blatant lack of grain, noise, blur or any other ''flaws''.  Just this once.  Thank you. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>What a great comment!</td>', 'Originally posted by ubique: I like the uncertain orientation, and I admire the perfect exposure.  I will forgive you for the blatant lack of grain, noise, blur or any other ''flaws''.  Just this once.  Thank you.   What a great comment!', '2010-11-17 14:28:26.000000', NULL, 0),
